'' A MODULE'S 'using' DOES NOT REACH ITS INTERFACE, so a declaration that named a type
'' through one -- another module's 'Box' after 'using shapes', its own 'inner.Tag' after
'' 'using inner', an enum constant as a default -- is written qualified there. The importer
'' used to report each bare name undeclared (TKO0808). A public enum's constants are public
'' too: 'shapes.GREEN' was TKO0860. The modules are '.tiko' files.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i tests/modules/src/usingdecl/libs tests/modules/src/usingdecl/app/main.bas -o tests/modules/usingdecl.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/usingdecl.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  45
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2 1
